  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Added authorization methods to client interfaces. 2024-11-27\n- feat: Now HttpClient will try to use HTTP/3.0 or HTTP/2.0 if available 2024-11-27\n- feat: Added additional format support like decimal/char/short/byte. 2024-11-27\n- feat: Updated to net9. 2024-11-13\n- feat: Replaced AnyOf JsonConverterFactory with explicit generic converters. 2024-11-13\n- feat(cli): Use net9 in sln template. 2024-11-13\n- feat: Added support for default responses. 2024-11-12\n- feat: Initial support for non success responses(through exceptions) 2024-11-12\n- feat: Initial work for System.ComponentModel.Annotations support. 2024-11-12\n- feat: Added default/example block to xml doc. 2024-11-12\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- test: Renamed files to fix Snapshot tests. 2024-12-03\n- fix: Fixed CLI. 2024-12-03\n- fix: Fixed Discriminator property name for some cases. 2024-12-03\n- fix: Use net8.0 for cli. 2024-12-03\n- fix: Fixed issue with Authorization Scheme if it Bearer instead bearer. 2024-11-27\n- fix: Added missing UnixTimestampJsonConverter in JsonSettings. 2024-11-18\n- fix(cli): Fixed warning for IsAotCompatible. 2024-11-14\n- fix: Fixed issue with incorrect ByteArray/String responses in release mode. 2024-11-13\n- fix(cli): Now draft PRs will not trigger PR test pipeline. 2024-11-13\n- fix(cli): Fixed mkdocs github actions template. 2024-11-13",
